 a consolidated Republican vote would push it toward Likely R.", "confidence": "medium", "notes": ["No usable general-election polls; forecast rests on fundamentals and expert ratings.", "Open seat: Ron DeSantis (R) is not on the ballot."]}, "overview": "Florida's governorship is open as Ron DeSantis terms out, and Republicans hold the structural edge in a state that ran about five points Republican at the presidential level. Congressman Byron Donalds has raised nearly $14 million, with Senator Rick Scott campaigning for him, while former congressman David Jolly, now a Democrat, trails badly in fundraising. Most rating outlets call the race Lean Republican, forecast averages put Donalds up roughly four points, and prediction markets give Democrats about a one-in-four chance.\n\nThe contest has tightened in the final month. Early-October surveys show a spread of results: one has the candidates tied at 45 percent, another has Donalds ahead 47-45, and others show a clearer Republican lead. Jolly appears to be holding some 2024 Trump voters, but Donalds' money advantage and Florida's rightward drift keep him favored with four weeks to go.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.1709, "margin": -5.38}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2654, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.2923, "margin": -3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2636, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.1983, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.2414, "margin": -3.8}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.2597, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.2217, "margin": -4.8}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.2584, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.252, "margin": -4.3}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.2745, "margin": -3.8}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.2552, "margin": -4.2}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.2498, "margin": -4.2}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.2281, "margin": -4.2}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.2